    "audience": "staff",
    "body": "The **Tournaments** page is your home page. It lists every tournament, with the next one first.\n\n**Where:** click **Tournaments** in the top bar.\n\n**To create a tournament:**\n1. Click **+ New Tournament**.\n2. Fill in **Tournament Name** (required), **Sport**, **Start Date**, **End Date** and **Location**.\n3. Optional: **Schedule Increment (minutes)**, **Number of fields** (Whistle Ready sets up Field 1 to N for you), **Daily start time** and **Daily end time**.\n4. Under **Team registration**, pick **Use built-in registration** (enter a **Team registration fee**) or **Import from another platform (CSV)**.\n5. Upload a logo if you have one, and tick divisions under **Divisions** (use **Select all defaults**, **Clear all**, or type one in **Add custom division…**).\n6. Click **Create Tournament**. If you chose CSV import, you go straight to the import page.\n\n**To copy a tournament (for next year):**\n1. Click **Copy** on the tournament card (or **Copy tournament** at the bottom of its **Dashboard**).\n2. Enter the **New Tournament Name** and dates, then click **Create Copy**.\n\nCopied: venues and fields, divisions, pay rates, ref rules, staff roster and registration settings. Left behind: games, schedule, registrations, assignments and availability.\n\n**Other card buttons:** **Edit** changes name, sport, dates, location and logo. **Schedule**, **Staff**, **Registrations**, **Pay Report** and **Builder** jump straight to those pages. Click the tournament name to open its **Dashboard**.\n\n**Tasks:** directors and admins see a **Tasks** box above the list, with what's up next across every event, and a line on each tournament card with its open and overdue tasks. Click it to open that event's tasks.\n\n**Finding older events:** use the **Upcoming**, **Past** and **All** filters.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- The **×** on a card deletes the tournament after a confirmation. It removes all games and assignments and cannot be undone.\n- Everything entered when creating can be changed later in **Setup → Tournament setup**."
