    "body": "The **Dashboard** is the tournament at a glance: teams registered, games, staff coverage and money.\n\n**Where:** **Dashboard** in the tournament menu.\n\n**What is on it:**\n- **At a glance** tiles: **Teams**, **Games**, **Staff assigned** and **Collected**. Click a tile to jump to that page.\n- **Tasks** (directors and admins): open and overdue tasks for this event, what's up next, and the setup checklist's progress. Click the circle to check a task off, or **Open tasks** for the full list.\n- **Live**: shortcuts to **Post scores**, **Assignments** and **Communications**.\n- **Registered teams**: **Teams by division**. Tap a division to see its teams. Teams on the waiting list show a **Waiting list** tag.\n- **Money**: **Revenue**, **Staff expenses**, **Gross profit**, **Balance due** and **Collection progress**, with a link to **View full financials**.\n\n**To show or hide money:**\n1. Click the **Money hidden** pill next to **At a glance** (or **Show** next to **Money**).\n2. Amounts, the **Collected** tile and the **Paid**, **Partial** and **Unpaid** marks on teams appear. Click **Money shown** to hide them again.\n\nMoney starts hidden every time you open the dashboard, so it is safe to turn the screen toward someone.\n\n**To open or close registration:** click the **Registration open** / **Registration closed** pill. It takes you to **Setup → Tournament setup → Registration types**.\n\n**To reorder the division tiles:** drag the grip on the left of a division. The order is saved for the tournament.\n\n**To copy this event for next year:** use **Copy tournament** under **Start next year's event from this one**.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- With no registrations yet, the page shows **Share registration form** instead of team lists."
