    "audience": "staff",
    "body": "Media credentials is where photographers and creators apply to shoot your event. You review each one and credential the ones you want on the field.\n\n**Where:** People → Media credentials\n\n**To review an application:**\n1. Click a row to see their details. Status shows **Needs review**, **Credentialed** or **Declined**.\n2. Click **Open portfolio** to see their work.\n3. Click **Credential & send pass** and confirm, or **Decline** and confirm.\n4. **Undo** puts it back to **Needs review**. **Delete** removes it for good.\n\n**To resend a credential:** click **Copy credential link** on an approved applicant and send it yourself.\n\n**To invite someone to shoot:**\n1. Open **Invite someone to shoot**.\n2. Pick a letter (for example **Come shoot with us**, **Back again**, **Short note**, **Join for the season**).\n3. Under **Who gets it**, paste one or more emails and click **Add**.\n4. Edit the **Subject** and **Body** and check the preview. Tick **Remember this wording** to keep it.\n5. Click **Send** and confirm. Or click **Copy letter** to send it from your own inbox.\n\n**Other tools:** **Open form** opens the application form. **Export CSV** downloads the list.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- **Credential & send pass** emails them their credential page with field rules and check-in details.\n- **Decline** sends no email.\n- People already invited for this event are skipped and listed under **Already invited**."
