    "body": "Photo bookings is your record of families who booked a photographer for this tournament. Families book photographers directly; you don't approve anything here.\n\n**Where:** People → Photo bookings\n\n**What you see:** each booking's **Photographer**, who it was **Booked by**, the **Player** (with club and division), the **Package** and **When**.\n\n**To see one photographer's bookings:** click their name in the row of buttons at the top. Click **All** to go back.\n\n**To open a booking:** click the row to see every detail. From there:\n- **Their page** opens the photographer's public page.\n- **Email the family** opens an email to the family.\n- **Delete** removes the booking for good (you'll be asked to confirm).\n\n**To download the list:** click **Export CSV**.\n\nIf there are no bookings yet, **Manage photographers** takes you to your photographers list."
