    "body": "Photos and video sent in by credentialed photographers and creators wait here for review. Nothing reaches the public gallery until you publish it.\n\n**Where:** People → Photos & video sent in\n\n**The tabs:**\n- **Needs review**: new files waiting on you.\n- **Live**: published to the public gallery.\n- **Not used**: files you set aside.\n\n**To publish photos:**\n1. On **Needs review**, click photos to select them, or click **Select all**.\n2. Click **Publish**.\n\n**To set photos aside:** select them and click **Don't use**.\n\n**To take a published photo down:** on **Live**, select it and click **Take down**.\n\n**To delete files:** select them, click **Delete** and confirm.\n\nClick **Load more** at the bottom to see more files.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- **Delete** removes the files from the gallery for good.\n- The buttons stay disabled until at least one file is selected."
