    "body": "Two small sections in Tournament setup control what parents see under **Info** on the public schedule page and which staff can post announcements.\n\n**Where:** **Setup → Tournament setup → Tournament info** and **Broadcast permissions**.\n\n**To add game-day info (parking, medical, lost and found):**\n1. Open **Tournament info** and click **+ Add section**.\n2. Pick an icon, type a **Section title** and the **Details**.\n3. Add as many sections as you need; the **×** removes one.\n4. Click **Save Changes**. Use **View it** to open the public page.\n\nUntil you save any sections, the public page shows sensible defaults.\n\n**To choose who can post announcements:**\n1. Open **Broadcast permissions**.\n2. Tick the roles allowed to post: **Schedulers**, **Assigners**, **Staff (field ops, medical, etc.)**, **Scorekeepers** or **Referees**. The **Tournament Director** is **Always allowed**.\n3. Click **Save Changes**.\n\nAllowed staff get a Broadcast page to post to the public announcement banner. You can remove any post."
