    "audience": "public",
    "body": "Each event can have a rules page and extra info pages (for example an FAQ) set up by the organizer.\n\n**Where:** **Rules** in the event page's **Event info** menu, the **Rules** section's **View** link, **Rules & policies** under **For players & parents**, or the **Rules** button on the Today page. Extra info pages open from sections on the event page.\n\n1. The **Rules** page shows the full rules, format and policies for the event.\n2. FAQ pages list questions; tap a question to read the answer.\n3. Tap **Back to event page** to return.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- **Rules haven't been posted yet.** means the organizer has not added them. Check back, or ask the event contact.\n- **This page has no content yet.** means the organizer has not filled that page in.\n- For a rule question the page does not answer, contact the organizer listed under **Questions?** on the event page."
