    "audience": "public",
    "body": "Photographers and videographers can apply for a media credential to shoot an event. The organizer reviews every application.\n\n**Where:** a link the organizer shares, at /tournaments/<id>/shoot.\n\n1. Read **What you get** and **Pick how far you want to take it** to see the options.\n2. Under **Media credential application**, fill in **Your name**, **Email**, **Phone** and **Portfolio link**. **Business name** is optional. Some events also require your **Instagram handle**.\n3. Tick **Where do you post?** and **Which events are you shooting?**\n4. Under **What do you want to do?**, pick one or more options.\n5. Optional: **Stills or video?**, **Camera and lenses**, **Liability insurance?** and **Anything else**.\n6. Read the terms, tick **I have read and agree to the above**, and tap **Send my application**.\n\n**Common problems:**\n- The credential preview says **not valid yet** until the organizer approves you.\n- You must pick at least one event and one option, and agree to the terms, before sending."
