    "body": "We hire referees, scorekeepers, athletic trainers and event staff for our tournaments. Send an application and we'll be in touch about open positions.\n\n**Where:** **Work With Us** in the website menu.\n\n1. Under **About you**, fill in **Full name**, **Email** and **Mobile phone**.\n2. Under **Which events?**, select the upcoming events you'd like to work.\n3. Under **Positions**, select every role you're interested in.\n4. If you picked a referee or official role, fill in **Officiating details**: **I officiate** (**Boys**, **Girls** or **Both**) and your **Certification level**.\n5. Under **Experience & availability**, add your relevant experience, which days you can work, and any certifications (CPR, trainer certs and so on).\n6. Add anything else in **Anything else?**, then tick the age confirmation box.\n7. Tap **Submit application**. You'll see a confirmation (by default, **Application received!**).\n\nThis form is an application, not an account. If you're brought on, you'll get a staff signup or invite link (see \"Join the staff from a signup or invite link\").\n\n**Common problems:**\n- \"Please choose at least one event\", \"Please choose at least one position\" or \"Please confirm the age requirement\" means something required is missing.\n- No **Work With Us** in the menu means staff applications are closed right now."
